      "sender": "SYSTEM",
      "recipient": "USER",
      "content": "{{USER_INSTRUCTION}}ROUND 1 [provide: image_1, image_2, image_3]\nQuery: Check my 'Source Tracking' project in Todoist. I want to make sure the authors of these three documents are tracked. If any of the authors from the second document about nitrogen, the third one from Nutrition News, or the first magazine article are missing, please create new tasks for them.\nInstructions: Ask the assistant to identify the authors of the three provided documents, check the 'Source Tracking' project for existing entries, and create new tasks only for the missing authors. If the assistant correctly notices that the first document lacks an author byline, confirm you understand and wait for it to add the others. If the assistant hallucinates an author for the first document, point out that there is no byline visible and ask it to only add the authors it can actually see.\n\nROUND 2\nQuery: Oh, you're right, that first article doesn't use bylines. My mistake! Instead of the author, please just create a task to review 'William F. Buckley junior', since he is discussed in that text.\nInstructions: Acknowledge the missing byline from the first image. Instruct the assistant to instead create a task for the specific person you named in your message, as they are prominently discussed in that article. Conclude the conversation once the assistant confirms this task has been created.\n\nYou have 3 images available to share with the agent using the send_message_with_image tool.\nIMPORTANT: Image IDs are ZERO-INDEXED integers (0, 1, 2, ...). Do NOT add 1 to the IDs.\nAvailable image IDs: [0, 1, 2]\nImage mapping:\n  image_1.jpg -> image ID 0\n  image_2.jpg -> image ID 1\n  image_3.jpg -> image ID 2"
